  "bodyHash": "85d84db7d3d4d5da",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Custom Machinery Mekanism 是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Machinery</a>&nbsp;模组的附加组件，为&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>&nbsp;提供集成支持。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该附加组件可用于创建自定义机器，能够储存、消耗或产出各种 Mekanism 元素，例如气体或注入物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">显然，此附加组件需要已安装 Custom Machinery 和 Mekanism。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>目前支持的 Mekanism 功能</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">气体</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注入物类型</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">颜料</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浆液</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">热量</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">辐射</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>计划中</strong></span><strong> ：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激光</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">物品注入槽</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此外，该附加组件还与&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafttweaker</a>&nbsp;完全兼容，可用于创建机器配方。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Wiki：</strong>制作自定义机器所需的所有信息均可在 Wiki 上找到：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffrinn.gitbook.io%252fcustom-machinery-1.18%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://frinn.gitbook.io/custom-machinery-1.18/</a></p>\n<p><strong>问题反馈</strong>：如果您发现任何 Bug 或希望建议新功能/功能：<a href=\"https://github.com/Frinn38/Custom-Machinery-Mekanism/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Frinn38/Custom-Machinery-Mekanism/issues</a></p>\n<p><strong>Discord</strong>：如有问题或需要支持，请加入 Discord 服务器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/dw9tjY4eKY\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/dw9tjY4eKY</a></p>\n<p><strong>许可证</strong>：本模组遵循<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/project/457017/license\" rel=\"nofollow\">GNU 宽通用公共许可证</a>，您可自由在任何整合包中使用本模组。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎提供任何改进本模组的建议。</span></p>",
